 "_about": "Expression-node model recovered from the engine, 2026-09-06.  0x00436B00 reads a selector byte, maps it through the u8 table at 0x00437380 (selector -> kind), and dispatches through the u32 table at 0x00437288 (kind -> handler).  Each handler was walked as a control-flow graph -- cases share epilogues and jump into one another, so a linear scan runs one case into the next -- and every ret-terminated path agreed, for all 62 handlers.  Payload = calls to 0x00438FA0 (u8) / 0x00438FC0 (u16); a sub-expression = recursion into 0x00436B00 or its wrapper 0x00437490.",
